WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023908 — Episode 32 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
You're the first heir to ever find me.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.900
I'm your mate, claim me, and the whole world will be at your feet.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Find you?

4
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.700
Sweetheart, the problem's never been finding you.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.600
It's getting rid of you.

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.880
Now get out, don't make me do it the hard way.

7
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:34.760
Were you even doing all the way out in the forest?

8
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.560
Same reason you were.

9
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:39.060
Don't tell me that dried up weed showed you a faded mate too.

10
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.060
No.

11
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.660
I'm human, remember?

12
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.560
Humans don't get a faded mate.

13
00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:47.260
We get three, so technically, I didn't lie to him.

14
00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:56.600
You don't have to play by anyone's rules.

15
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.700
You get to pick your own mate.

16
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:04.700
Have you picked yours?

17
00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.040
You're alive!

18
00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.140
Knew it!
